    * chore(deps): upgrade puppeteer to v25
    
    Bump puppeteer from ^24.4.0 to ^25.17.0 (root and render-fidelity-tools).
    
    Puppeteer v25 breaking changes and their impact here:
    - ESM-only packages: render-fidelity-tools is already an ES module
      ("type": "module") and imports puppeteer via ESM, so no change needed.
    - executablePath() and defaultArgs() now return a Promise: not used.
    - Minimum Node.js is now 22: pin actions/setup-node to .nvmrc (Node 24)
      in all workflows instead of relying on the runner's default Node, and
      raise render-fidelity-tools' engines.node to >=22.0.0.
    
    Verified locally: fidelity tests pass on all 85 scenarios.
    
    * chore(deps): upgrade @web/test-runner to v1
    
