    * ci: pin GitHub Actions to commit SHAs
    
    The zizmor check fails on pull requests that change a workflow file
    containing actions referenced by tag. Pin every action to the commit
    its current tag points to, with the version in a comment, and give the
    read-only workflows an explicit `contents: read` permission.
